{"version":1,"content":"<p>360公司就副總裁、市場部負責人卜思南被傳接受調查一事作出正式回應。360表示，公司內審發現卜思南涉嫌經濟問題後，已向公安機關報案，目前其正在接受有關部門調查。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586722.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:29:31.947447+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:11:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:22:50.383377+00:00","content_hash":"63545326fca9b51afbfcc8c79d795010032a0b2b0bdc6b7813cbf98b47540891","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}